@startuml 09_seq_leave_and_disconnect
title Sequence: Leave a Session and Dead-Connection Handling (UC-5, UC-10, UC-11)
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260

actor "Client A" as A
actor "Client B\n(remaining player)" as B
participant "server.Client (A)" as CA
participant "Session\n(actor)" as S
participant "chess.Game" as G
participant "store" as DB <<planned>>

== Explicit leave (implemented) ==
A -> CA : LeaveSessionRequest(seq n, session_id)
alt connection has no session or the id differs
  CA --> A : ErrorResponse(NOT_IN_SESSION)
else member
  CA -> S : Leave(clientID)
  S -> S : remove Member and its join-order entry
  S --> B : StateUpdate(roster without A, unsolicited)
  CA --> A : LeaveSessionResponse(in_reply_to n, session_id)
end
note over S #FFF3CD
  PLANNED (FR-20, FR-21, FR-34):
  1. If a match is running, ask the game for its leave policy (forfeit, pause, fallback)
     and send MatchResult(reason FORFEIT) when the match ends.
  2. When the last member leaves, remove the session from SessionStore and stop its goroutine.
end note

== Dead connection (heartbeat detection is implemented; session cleanup is PLANNED) ==
loop every PingInterval (10 s)
  CA -> A : heartbeat (zero-length frame)
  A --> CA : heartbeat reply (resets the server read deadline)
end
A -[#red]x CA : connection goes silent
CA -> CA : read deadline expires (ReadTimeout), readLoop returns,\ncontext cancelled, socket closed
CA -> S : PLANNED: Disconnect(clientID)
S --> B : StateUpdate(A.connected = false)
S -> S : start grace timer
alt A resumes before the grace period ends (stretch goal, UC-11)
  A -> CA : ConnectRequest, then AuthRequest(player_id, reconnect_token)
  CA -> S : rebind sender to the new connection, close any older connection
  S --> A : StateUpdate(in_reply_to 0, current view)
  S --> B : StateUpdate(A.connected = true)
else grace period expires
  S -> G : disconnect policy (forfeit, pause, or fallback)
  S --> B : StateUpdate and MatchResult(reason DISCONNECT)
  S -> DB : SaveMatch(...)
end
@enduml
